@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@routineId = 88b41a79-f9bf-45f7-80df-1e8cda4ad012

### 1. Ambil daftar awal
GET {{baseUrl}}/routines


### 2. Tambah routine
POST {{baseUrl}}/routines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Upper Body A",
  "fokus": "Biseps, bahu, dan triseps",
  "tanggalLatihan": "2026-11-20",
  "tingkat": "pemula"
}


### 3. Ambil seluruh routine setelah POST
GET {{baseUrl}}/routines


### 4. Ambil satu routine
GET {{baseUrl}}/routines/{{routineId}}


### 5. Ubah routine
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/routines/{{routineId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fokus": "Dada, bahu, dan triseps",
  "tingkat": "menengah",
  "selesai": true
}


### 6. Uji nama duplikat
POST {{baseUrl}}/routines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Upper Body A",
  "fokus": "Biseps dan bahu",
  "tingkat": "pemula"
}


### 7. Uji validasi input
POST {{baseUrl}}/routines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "AB",
  "fokus": "Bahu",
  "tanggalLatihan": "tanggal-salah",
  "tingkat": "expert"
}


### 8. Uji validasi PATCH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/routines/{{routineId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "selesai": "ya"
}


### 9. Uji data tidak ditemukan
GET {{baseUrl}}/routines/tidak-ada


### 10. Hapus routine
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/routines/{{routineId}}


### 11. Periksa daftar setelah DELETE
GET {{baseUrl}}/routines

### 12. Statistik routine (query lanjutan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/routines/stats